        <qualifiedname>Validator::getRules</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Returns the nine scout rules: the seven config rules, <computeroutput>toolchain</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>sample</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput>toolchain</computeroutput> fails a <computeroutput>## toolchain</computeroutput> table whose header row lacks a <computeroutput>command</computeroutput> column or a <computeroutput>flag</computeroutput> column. The failure names the table and the header row. <computeroutput>sample</computeroutput> fails a <computeroutput>## sample</computeroutput> table whose <computeroutput>intervalMs</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>stackDepth</computeroutput> is out of range. The failure names the table and the header row.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>The rules, keyed by rule name, built once. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
