    <briefdescription>
<para>Column-rule validation for a scout manifest <ndash/> the config rules, the toolchain column rule and the sample range rule. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="struct_validator_1af387720572933d5519b0597814433c17" kindref="member">addRules()</ref> composes ConfigValidator&apos;s seven rules with two more rules: <computeroutput>toolchain</computeroutput> fails a <computeroutput>## toolchain</computeroutput> table whose header row declares no <computeroutput>command</computeroutput> column or no <computeroutput>flag</computeroutput> column. <computeroutput>sample</computeroutput> fails a <computeroutput>## sample</computeroutput> table whose <computeroutput>intervalMs</computeroutput> is below <ref refid="class_sampler_1a06a006e3b2e6f8b0a67a07707ae4b70c" kindref="member">Sampler::minimumIntervalMs</ref>, or whose <computeroutput>stackDepth</computeroutput> is outside <ref refid="class_sampler_1ae2192afc9784395ea7cb7d05270318d3" kindref="member">Sampler::minimumStackDepth</ref> and <ref refid="class_sampler_1a7cf4f7bbc391afd66a215460984f8443" kindref="member">Sampler::maximumStackDepth</ref>. <ref refid="struct_validator_1a394659562ffe86296738ed5a5b14f80f" kindref="member">getRules()</ref> returns the nine rules, built once. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
